     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear all, <div>I am having some issues using an imputed dataset (created with MICE) with lavaan.mi.  I am definitely doing something wrong when creating the dataset list, so I was wondering if you could help me locating the source of the error and perhaps point me to some reference/explanation. </div><div><br></div><div>So, If I impute a dataset (I use defaults in this example)</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">impcos </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mice</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cos</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> m </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">20</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> diagnostics </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br>then do this<div><br></div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">dat </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> complete</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">impcos</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;long&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> inc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>and then <div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">fit </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cfa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mi</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">COS</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mi</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dat$imp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> estimator </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;MLM&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> chi</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;all&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br><div>I receive an error stating that data is not a valid input type. I have tried a lot of different combinations but nothing. I am sure it is something very basic and obvious, but how do create an object with MICE that can be used with lavaan.mi?</div></div></div><div><br></div><div>Also, (not related to lavaan.mi) once the dataset list is created how do I save it as a .rdata file? </div><div><br></div><div>Is this the right function to do so? </div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p></p><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">write</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mice</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">imputation</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mi</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">res</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> impcos </span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;impcos&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br><br>Thanks very much<br></div><div><br></div><div>Giovanni</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
