     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">All sorted -- if someone in the future needs: <div><br></div><div>To transform the mice object in something lavaan can use:</div><div><br></div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">dat </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NULL<br><br> <br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">20</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br> dat</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> complete</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">YOURIMPUTEDDATA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> action</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> include</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  <br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></div></code></div><p><br></p></div><div><br></div><div>and then use the save function.</div><div>Best</div><div>Giovanni </div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Friday, 14 April 2017 20:07:32 UTC+1, Dr G Travaglino (University of Kent) wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Dear all, <div>I am having some issues using an imputed dataset (created with MICE) with lavaan.mi.  I am definitely doing something wrong when creating the dataset list, so I was wondering if you could help me locating the source of the error and perhaps point me to some reference/explanation. </div><div><br></div><div>So, If I impute a dataset (I use defaults in this example)</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">impcos </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mice</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cos</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> m </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">20</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> diagnostics </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br>then do this<div><br></div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">dat </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> complete</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">impcos</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;long&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> inc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>and then <div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">fit </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cfa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mi</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">COS</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mi</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dat$imp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> estimator </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;MLM&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> chi</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;all&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br><div>I receive an error stating that data is not a valid input type. I have tried a lot of different combinations but nothing. I am sure it is something very basic and obvious, but how do create an object with MICE that can be used with lavaan.mi?</div></div></div><div><br></div><div>Also, (not related to lavaan.mi) once the dataset list is created how do I save it as a .rdata file? </div><div><br></div><div>Is this the right function to do so? </div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p></p><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">write</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mice</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">imputation</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mi</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">res</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> impcos </span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;impcos&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><br><br>Thanks very much<br></div><div><br></div><div>Giovanni</div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
